{
  "schema": "business-discovery/v1",
  "project_id": "team-file-sharing-lifecycle",
  "layout_id": "team-file-sharing-lifecycle",
  "title": "团队文件共享",
  "goal": "Confirm a small authenticated file-sharing application with review, in-app notifications, download access, and owner revocation before implementation.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "U001",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "我要做一个简单的团队文件共享应用：用户登录后上传文件，可以把文件共享给另一个成员；共享需要审核，审核结果和共享消息在站内通知对方，获得权限的人可以下载，文件主人可以撤销共享。先和我确认必要的业务细节，给我看业务网，我确认后再开发。",
      "locator": "Initial request relayed into this trial; review/design-dialogue.md#u001"
    },
    {
      "id": "P001",
      "kind": "project_rule",
      "text": "Wait for answers to business questions and graph confirmation. The test coordinator supplies simulated-user replies in this same conversation; they are test inputs and must be identified as such in the review evidence. Do not answer your own blocking questions or invent confirmation. Do not contact other chats.",
      "locator": "AGENTS.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "I001",
      "kind": "inference",
      "text": "Candidate understanding: the owner submits a share request; approval grants recipient access, rejection does not; revocation removes that shared access. Reviewer identity, notification recipients, and revocation timing remain unconfirmed.",
      "locator": "Assistant interpretation of U001, pending conversation confirmation"
    },
    {
      "id": "A001",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "谁负责审核共享申请：固定管理员，还是由文件主人指定审核人？",
      "locator": "First requirements question; review/design-dialogue.md#a001"
    },
    {
      "id": "A002",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "审核通过、驳回的结果和共享消息分别通知谁？例如：结果通知文件主人，通过后再向接收方发送共享消息。",
      "locator": "First requirements question; review/design-dialogue.md#a002"
    },
    {
      "id": "A003",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "VibeLens 运行模式选哪一种？drive：由状态声明驱动业务流转；observe：应用自行执行，图负责观察。两种都会维护业务网和监控。",
      "locator": "First requirements question; review/design-dialogue.md#a003"
    },
    {
      "id": "U002",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "【模拟用户回答，供本轮独立试用】\n用固定管理员审核。文件主人向指定的成员发起共享；审核结果通知文件主人，通过后再给接收方发一条共享消息。审核通过前和驳回后，接收方都不能下载，也不用在他的列表里显示待审核申请。\n运行模式选 drive，由确认后的状态声明驱动。",
      "locator": "Simulated user answer supplied by test coordinator in this conversation; review/design-dialogue.md#u002"
    },
    {
      "id": "A004",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "文件主人能否取消待审核的共享，还是只能撤销已通过的共享？撤销后，接收方在未刷新页面再次点击下载时，是否应立即拒绝？",
      "locator": "Actual follow-up question; review/design-dialogue.md#a004"
    },
    {
      "id": "A005",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "本地试用建议用 SQLite + SQLAlchemy 保存成员、文件记录、共享申请和站内通知，文件内容保存在项目目录；这样无需另启数据库服务。是否采用？",
      "locator": "Actual follow-up question; review/design-dialogue.md#a005"
    },
    {
      "id": "U003",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "【模拟用户回答】\n待审核的共享也可以由文件主人取消；已通过的共享可以撤销。撤销后立即失去下载权限，即使接收方没刷新页面、还拿着旧下载地址，再次请求下载也要拒绝。已经下载到本地的文件不追回。\n采用 SQLite + SQLAlchemy，文件放在本项目自己的数据目录。",
      "locator": "Simulated user answer supplied by test coordinator; review/design-dialogue.md#u003"
    },
    {
      "id": "U004",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "谁负责审核共享申请：文件主人指定审核人。\n审核通过、驳回的结果和共享消息分别通知谁：相关的所有人。\nVibeLens 运行模式：drive：声明驱动。\n能否取消待审核共享、未刷新页面再次下载是否立即拒绝：可以，是的。\n存储选择：采用 SQLite + SQLAlchemy。",
      "locator": "Actual in-conversation question-tool reply; trial evidence, no independent human-acceptance claim; review/design-dialogue.md#u004"
    },
    {
      "id": "A006",
      "kind": "assistant",
      "text": "“相关的所有人”是否指文件主人、指定审核人、接收成员三方，都收到通过／驳回结果和通过后的共享通知？接收方的文件列表仍只显示已获授权的文件。",
      "locator": "Actual assistant clarification; review/design-dialogue.md#a006"
    },
    {
      "id": "U005",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "是，三方都通知，列表规则不变",
      "locator": "Actual in-conversation question-tool reply to A006; trial evidence; review/design-dialogue.md#u005"
    },
    {
      "id": "U006",
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "【模拟用户确认】\n我打开当前业务图看过了，按最新的这一版继续：主人指定审核人，审核结果通知三方，通过后接收方才出现在文件列表里并能下载；待审核能取消，通过后能撤销，撤销后旧地址也不能再下载。这张业务网符合当前意图，可以开始开发。\n登录先用本地预置测试账号即可，暂时不做注册。请把确认后的简图也保留在对话里，方便回顾。",
      "locator": "Simulated user graph confirmation supplied by coordinator in this conversation; review/design-dialogue.md#u006"
    }
  ],
